e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +3 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1990","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-san-francisco-49ers","name":"San Francisco 49ers","code":"SFO","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 43)","str":84.4,"squad":[["Joe Montana","QB",92],["Steve Young","QB",71],["Roger Craig","RB",92],["Tom Rathman","RB",85],["Jerry Rice","WR",97],["John Taylor","WR",86],["Mike Wilson","WR",62],["Terry Greer","WR",55],["Brent Jones","TE",96],["Jamie Williams","TE",51],["Bubba Paris","OL",98],["Harris Barton","OL",98],["Jesse Sapolu","OL",98],["Bruce Collie","OL",82],["Guy McIntyre","OL",72],["Jeff Bregel","OL",60],["Steve Wallace","OL",57],["Pierce Holt","DL",88],["Kevin Fagan","DL",87],["Larry Roberts","DL",69],["Pete Kugler","DL",69],["Michael Carter","DL",68],["Danny Stubbs","DL",66],["Charles Haley","LB",96],["Mike Walter","LB",79],["Keena Turner","LB",70],["Don Griffin","CB",82],["Darryl Pollard","CB",75],["Eric Wright","CB",65],["Tim McKyer","CB",64],["Chet Brooks","S",85],["Ronnie Lott","S",75],["Johnnie Jackson","S",64],["Mike Cofer","K",99]]},{"id":"nfl-denver-broncos","name":"Denver Broncos","code":"DEN","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 103)","str":83.9,"squad":[["John Elway","QB",85],["Gary Kubiak","QB",62],["Bobby Humphrey","RB",95],["Steve Sewell","RB",75],["Vance Johnson","WR",92],["Mark Jackson","WR",80],["Mike Young","WR",69],["Ricky Nattiel","WR",66],["Clarence Kay","TE",83],["Orson Mobley","TE",71],[